{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/73d2ed1df6e3ddcd42240cb6ce1c0807.avif?t=1765107924\" width=1200 height=200 /></span><strong>A story-driven game with a vast lore-rich world, filled with interactions~!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This game follows Leere, a girl that was sent to an unknown land with vague memories of her old world...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>It's a difficult situation where our Heroine has no easy way to return and has to struggle to have even a possibility of coming back, but... maybe the world she found herself in isn't a bad place? Maybe it's worth to explore it further instead of going back? But well... time is ticking and anxiety only strengthens with time</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a (generally?) colorful world together with the heroine</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse vivid regions full of various characters and enemies (they have very engaging  personalities)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and find powerful wands and special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter challenges and puzzles, and solve them to earn big rewards or amusing reactions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn more about the current world and its mysterious history</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/bbcf61ff9ef0c2e7bb5f4cc61c7bc473.poster.avif?t=1765107924\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/bbcf61ff9ef0c2e7bb5f4cc61c7bc473.webm?t=1765107924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/bbcf61ff9ef0c2e7bb5f4cc61c7bc473.mp4?t=1765107924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the mysterious reason why the main heroine was sent to this world and the connections between her and this new realm?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talking with the various local characters can reveal even more~!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/7efa3b4947811a5443bd091bb21d70f6.avif?t=1765107924\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Vibrant characters that (may?) share the journey with you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet the story-related characters who will definitely want to make themselves known!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/aa890db59385210d31034b4fdab0b162.avif?t=1765107924\" width=1400 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They may follow you and provide their unique perspectives and abilities~</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;general&quot; is quite tall... so I couldn't entirely fit him...\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/7efa3b4947811a5443bd091bb21d70f6.avif?t=1765107924\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Intense bullet hell gameplay!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight a variety of enemies, each with a unique attack pattern.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your agility to dash through projectiles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge certain attacks with precise movements</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Obtain different types of wands that completely change your battle approach </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make use of powerful special abilities with distinctive powers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, test your skills against truly powerful bosses!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players with less experience in bullet-hell games, an easier difficulty level is available!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/d6c399293e2e11ad55d85e8eae52e68d.poster.avif?t=1765107924\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/d6c399293e2e11ad55d85e8eae52e68d.webm?t=1765107924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/d6c399293e2e11ad55d85e8eae52e68d.mp4?t=1765107924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore each new location, the challenges keep getting tougher!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/c532f5e0f251c0d547605c64bf1f091f.poster.avif?t=1765107924\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/c532f5e0f251c0d547605c64bf1f091f.webm?t=1765107924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/c532f5e0f251c0d547605c64bf1f091f.mp4?t=1765107924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/7efa3b4947811a5443bd091bb21d70f6.avif?t=1765107924\" width=1200 height=68 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Immersive soundtrack and animated illustrations!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn and animated illustrations enhance interactions and create an amazing atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features 60+ animated illustrations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On top of that, dialogues and cutscenes are supported by stunning visual effects, sound effects, and handcrafted music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack is immersive, becoming intense during key battles and emotional at the right moments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/35b05ef77810c84c37b9fb2a298bd303.poster.avif?t=1765107924\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/35b05ef77810c84c37b9fb2a298bd303.webm?t=1765107924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/35b05ef77810c84c37b9fb2a298bd303.mp4?t=1765107924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4013600/extras/73d2ed1df6e3ddcd42240cb6ce1c0807.avif?t=1765107924\" width=1200 height=200 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4013600?t=1765107924","background_raw":